            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Version 0.9.8</h2>

<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
  <li>
    Fix bugs
  </li>
  <li>
    When session stop, the float window will bloom animation to show the session has stopped, and then disappear after animation.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Multi language support</strong>
    CCWatcher now supports multiple languages, including English, Spanish, Vietnamese, Chinese, Japanese, Korean. Users can switch between languages in the settings menu.
  </li>
</ul>
]]></description>
